## 1️⃣3️⃣ Deployment

| Platform | Pros | Typical URL |
|----------|------|-------------|
| **Vercel** | Instant preview, SSR support | `https://your-site.vercel.app` |
| **Netlify** | Edge functions, form handling | `https://your-site.netlify.app` |
| **Render** | Docker, auto‑scale | `https://your-site.onrender.com` |
| **AWS Amplify** | Full stack, CI/CD | `https://your-site.amplifyapp.com` |

**CI/CD pipeline** (GitHub Actions example)

```yaml
name: Deploy

on:
  push:
    branches: [main]

jobs:
  build-deploy:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - uses: actions/setup-node@v3
        with:
          node-version: '20'
      - run: npm ci
      - run: npm run build
      - uses: vercel/action@v1
        with:
          vercel-token: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_TOKEN }}
          vercel-org-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_ORG_ID }}
          vercel-project-id: ${{ secrets.VERCEL_PROJECT_ID }}
```

---

## 1️⃣4️⃣ Checklist Before Launch

- [ ] Responsive design (mobile‑first)
- [ ] Accessibility audit (WCAG 2.1 AA)
- [ ] SEO meta tags, structured data
- [ ] Performance budget (Lighthouse score > 90)
- [ ] Error boundaries & graceful degradation
- [ ] Analytics (Google Analytics, Hotjar)
- [ ] Security hardening (CSP, HSTS, CSRF tokens)
- [ ] Backup & rollback strategy

